          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已在磁盘，%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On launch, Rapid-MLX loads your last-used model into memory so the chat is interactive immediately. Nothing loads while first-run setup is still open. Turn off if you sometimes open Rapid-MLX just to browse past conversations — you can still start a model manually by picking one in the message box and sending." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "启动时，Rapid-MLX 会把你上次使用的模型载入内存，让对话立即可用。首次运行的设置向导未关闭时不会加载任何内容。如果你有时只是打开 Rapid-MLX 浏览历史对话，可以关闭此项；之后仍可在消息框中选择模型并发送来手动启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
